{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dylio\u2019s Adventures</strong> is a casual <strong>Rogue Runner</strong> with a charming 3D <i>cartoon-toy</i> aesthetic. Step into the shell of <strong>Dylio</strong>, a peculiar armadillo who must overcome obstacles and challenges along mysterious cosmic paths in a dreamlike world generated procedurally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to help Dylio recover the treasures that a mysterious crow has stolen and make it back home safe and sound, with his original appearance intact?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/4dec1afa850e83baf958cdeea79e0d85.avif?t=1773246266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras_big/4dec1afa850e83baf958cdeea79e0d85.webp?t=1773246266 width=1560 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/8bb91dc5940546b78636d71cba7edfc9.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel through strange material portals to transform Dylio</strong>, gaining new abilities that will help you follow the trail of feathers left behind by the crow while dodging obstacles and hostile creatures before the level portal reopens and transports you somewhere new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLAY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/0e435a856003a3591fb734e12d5412b2.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/0e435a856003a3591fb734e12d5412b2.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/0e435a856003a3591fb734e12d5412b2.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of <strong>Clay Dylio</strong>, you can shrink our protagonist just in time to slip away from creatures trying to capture you, cross fragile bridges, or sneak beneath logs and gaps between rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay away from heat sources\u2026 or you might suffer a very strange transformation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUBBER BALL:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/361a5eeaa382ec6bf15ada8086a4c52b.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/361a5eeaa382ec6bf15ada8086a4c52b.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/361a5eeaa382ec6bf15ada8086a4c52b.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump with <strong>Rubber Ball Dylio</strong> to easily reach higher platforms and clear gaps in the ground. But beware of uncontrollable bounces\u2014you\u2019ll lose control for a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the fastest material, so use its speed to switch lanes quickly and move with agility.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STONE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/97a26736b7cbb131d136702c1beb88fe.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/97a26736b7cbb131d136702c1beb88fe.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/97a26736b7cbb131d136702c1beb88fe.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard as a rock!</strong> (Well\u2026 not quite a diamond.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Stone Dylio\u2019s</strong> ability to charge forward and smash through anything in your path\u2014but <strong>watch your stamina</strong>. You\u2019ll only have three durability points, which will wear down depending on how tough the obstacles you hit are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this material\u2019s sprints strategically to cover long distances quickly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELIUM BALLOON:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/7b1f2b5c623cf9cdded4c8625f594756.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/7b1f2b5c623cf9cdded4c8625f594756.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/7b1f2b5c623cf9cdded4c8625f594756.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light as a feather!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch <strong> Balloon Dylio</strong> carefully to avoid ground obstacles and glide across long distances through the air. But be careful\u2014touching any creature or surface will make you pop instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6c563e7ad304997c973879a15eb18721.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That strange crow stole his Backpack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail of <strong>feathers</strong> it leaves behind and collect them. When you gather <strong>five</strong>, the mysterious bird will appear in front of Dylio and you\u2019ll have the chance to recover one of your treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to finish the level, you\u2019ll keep it as a <strong>sticker in your Collection notebook</strong>. But if you perish along the way, you\u2019ll lose all the treasures obtained during that run and will have to recover them again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/8004d47869590c82d50da9124ce3d01d.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recover <strong>up to 4 treasures per level</strong>. Collect them to unlock more levels, new game modes, and complete your sticker collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6f7b8f069ab8c2473ee07b0fcc97ae24.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6f7b8f069ab8c2473ee07b0fcc97ae24.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6f7b8f069ab8c2473ee07b0fcc97ae24.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/94ebf6dc7154e47632e188bb258d1207.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your inner Speedrunner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover enough treasures to unlock a new <strong>time-based mode</strong> in each level, where you\u2019ll need to master every one of Dylio\u2019s transformations to finish as fast as possible and earn new stickers for your album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/4b36156320fd30682d8853f40b74f102.avif?t=1773246266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras_big/4b36156320fd30682d8853f40b74f102.webp?t=1773246266 width=1560 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/887eb697dd5d2bbf030e903a2e484732.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the Leaderboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score as many points as possible in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, a challenge where you must survive while collecting crow feathers and chaining transformations, progressing through increasingly demanding stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P.S.:</strong> That sneaky crow will keep chasing you all night until it steals every last one of your treasures\u2026 unless you <strong>Wishlist Dylio\u2019s Adventures</strong> and <strong>Follow the game</strong> to stay updated on release plans and future news!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/039b374492a23d6cb9ca3310e61ce00a.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/039b374492a23d6cb9ca3310e61ce00a.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/039b374492a23d6cb9ca3310e61ce00a.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493880?t=1773246266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773246266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/aca4c1296918737fdde72b19c6c75ef82a793be3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773246266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/aca4c1296918737fdde72b19c6c75ef82a793be3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773246266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dylio\u2019s Adventures</strong> is a casual <