surface will make you pop instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6c563e7ad304997c973879a15eb18721.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That strange crow stole his Backpack!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail of <strong>feathers</strong> it leaves behind and collect them. When you gather <strong>five</strong>, the mysterious bird will appear in front of Dylio and you\u2019ll have the chance to recover one of your treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to finish the level, you\u2019ll keep it as a <strong>sticker in your Collection notebook</strong>. But if you perish along the way, you\u2019ll lose all the treasures obtained during that run and will have to recover them again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/8004d47869590c82d50da9124ce3d01d.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recover <strong>up to 4 treasures per level</strong>. Collect them to unlock more levels, new game modes, and complete your sticker collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6f7b8f069ab8c2473ee07b0fcc97ae24.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6f7b8f069ab8c2473ee07b0fcc97ae24.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/6f7b8f069ab8c2473ee07b0fcc97ae24.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/94ebf6dc7154e47632e188bb258d1207.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your inner Speedrunner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover enough treasures to unlock a new <strong>time-based mode</strong> in each level, where you\u2019ll need to master every one of Dylio\u2019s transformations to finish as fast as possible and earn new stickers for your album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/4b36156320fd30682d8853f40b74f102.avif?t=1773246266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras_big/4b36156320fd30682d8853f40b74f102.webp?t=1773246266 width=1560 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/887eb697dd5d2bbf030e903a2e484732.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the Leaderboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score as many points as possible in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, a challenge where you must survive while collecting crow feathers and chaining transformations, progressing through increasingly demanding stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P.S.:</strong> That sneaky crow will keep chasing you all night until it steals every last one of your treasures\u2026 unless you <strong>Wishlist Dylio\u2019s Adventures</strong> and <strong>Follow the game</strong> to stay updated on release plans and future news!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/039b374492a23d6cb9ca3310e61ce00a.poster.avif?t=1773246266\" width=1170 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/039b374492a23d6cb9ca3310e61ce00a.webm?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/039b374492a23d6cb9ca3310e61ce00a.mp4?t=1773246266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lava Candy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/header.jpg?t=1773246266","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Dylios' Adventures \u24b8 2026 Developed by Lava Candy Games \u00ae. Lava Candy Games is a registered trademark. All other trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15.3 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest macOS<br></li><li><strong>